## chart not-a-fork MMDX Is A Wrapper
```mermaid
gitGraph
  commit id: "Mermaid syntax"
  commit id: "Ordinary chart fences"
  branch mmdx-wrapper
  checkout mmdx-wrapper
  commit id: "metadata comment"
  commit id: "named charts"
  commit id: "label links"
  checkout main
  commit id: "Charts still parse"
  merge mmdx-wrapper id: "Viewer reads extra state"
```
